 and nontechnical audiences, colleagues and clients, peers and supervisors, and in-house departments), work in teams, and address organizational and ethical issues including using GenAI, racism, equity, inclusiveness, and accessibility. The course material is drawn from professional contexts, principally engineering, and it generates lively discussion.", "catalogBreadth": null, "catalogDistr": null, "catalogEnrollmentPriority": "Enrollment limited to: EN and BEE juniors and seniors, or permission of instructor.", "catalogLang": null, "catalogForbiddenOverlaps": null, "catalogAttribute": null, "catalogWhenOffered": null, "catalogComments": null, "catalogPrereqCoreq": null, "catalogPrereq": "two (2) First-Year Writing Seminars and major affiliation.", "catalogCoreq": "", "catalogFee": null, "catalogSatisfiesReq": null, "catalogPermission": null, "catalogCourseSubfield": null, "catalogOutcomes": null, "acadCareer": "UG", "acadGroup": "EN", "catalogName": null, "catalogNextOffered": null, "lastTermsOffered": "2025FA, 2025SU, 2025SP, 2024FA", "catalogCredits": null, "catalogGradeOption": null, "catalogLocation": null, "catalogCrosslisted": null, "catalogCrosslistings": null, "catalogComeets": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": []}, {"strm": 2909, "crseId": 372787, "crseOfferNbr": 1, "subject": "ENGRC", "catalogNbr": "3700", "titleShort": "Communications Consulting Engr", "titleLong": "Communications Consulting for Engineers", "crseAttrs": [{"crseAttr": "0012", "crseAttrValue": "CE-EN", "descr": "EN-Communications in Engineer", "descrformal": "EN-Communications in Engineering", "attrDescr": "Distribution Requirements", "attrDescrShort": "DistReq"}], "crseAttrValueGroups": [{"attrDescr": "Distribution Requirements", "crseAttrValues": "(CE-EN)"}], "enrollGroups": [{"classSections": [{"ssrComponent": "SEM", "ssrComponentLong": "Seminar", "section": "101", "classNbr": 8175, "meetings": [{"classMtgNbr": 1, "timeStart": "02:55PM", "timeEnd": "04:10PM", "startDt": "08/25/2025", "endDt"